+## Palette freeze (historical record)
+
+**Decision (issue #1245):** freeze this library in place. Do **not** rewrite
+`palette.rocket_orange`, `style_suffix`, or the embedded `#ef8b39` hex values
+to the live ATA accent `#b93800`.
+
+These prompts are the record of how the existing session imagery was generated.
+Updating them in place would make the library describe images that were never
+produced from it; versioning a parallel current-palette file is deferred until
+a new generation batch is actually planned. Future generations that need the
+post-#1239 accent should introduce a new catalog (or version field) at that
+time rather than mutating this historical file.
+
 The server-only loader in `src/lib/session-images/catalog.ts` validates the
 entire catalog before returning it. Validation covers the declared count,
 stable IDs and filenames, canonical track names, 20 slots per track, bounded
